  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "46678602-7904-4cd8-9bdf-2647db216015",
      "question": "Which 10 stocks were the most central in the declared-peer return-correlation network from December 2025 through March 12, 2026, and which SEC industries are they in?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T18:55:44.175154Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T18:56:20.385566Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 10 most central stocks in the declared-peer return-correlation network (Dec 2025 – Mar 12, 2026)**\n\n| Rank | Ticker | PageRank Centrality | SIC Code | SEC Industry |\n|------|--------|---------------------|----------|--------------|\n| 1 | BMY | 0.00809 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 2 | ABBV | 0.00728 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 3 | PFE | 0.00645 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 4 | LLY | 0.00601 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 5 | MRK | 0.00601 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 6 | JNJ | 0.00590 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 7 | AZN | 0.00530 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 8 | ABT | 0.00492 | 2834 | Pharmaceutical Preparations |\n| 9 | COLB | 0.00361 | 6022 | State Commercial Banks |\n| 10 | CRWD | 0.00356 | 7372 | Services-Prepackaged Software |\n\nEight of the ten most central stocks are in the **Pharmaceutical Preparations** industry (SIC 2834). The remaining two are a regional bank (COLB, SIC 6022) and a cybersecurity software firm (CRWD, SIC 7372). Centrality here measures PageRank in the graph of daily-return correlations among declared same-industry peers; it does not imply causation. [1][2]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — analyze market relationships — evidence `hermes-receipt:49b91afa60bf2aa6bee7df2d6db562342943d49e4a71f41700231cef3e7bf493`\n- [2] Structured retrieval result — us_equities — evidence `hermes-receipt:a0fdf86e92198557245e64c9baa9fa6d5ac487280a8a6cc67575ac99de567683`",
