            "answer": "This query retrieves the SIC code and its industry description for each of the specified tickers by filtering the assets table for those ticker symbols and presenting the results in the same order as the list provided in the question.",
            "sql": "SELECT asset_id AS ticker, sic_code, industry FROM us_equities.main.assets WHERE asset_id IN ('BMY','ABBV','PFE','LLY','MRK','JNJ','AZN','ABT','COLB','CRWD') ORDER BY CASE asset_id WHEN 'BMY' THEN 1 WHEN 'ABBV' THEN 2 WHEN 'PFE' THEN 3 WHEN 'LLY' THEN 4 WHEN 'MRK' THEN 5 WHEN 'JNJ' THEN 6 WHEN 'AZN' THEN 7 WHEN 'ABT' THEN 8 WHEN 'COLB' THEN 9 WHEN 'CRWD' THEN 10 ELSE 11 END;",
